      "durationSeconds": 6.2,
      "bytes": 51255
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_Narrator_npc_arthur_dinner_watch_L02",
      "text": "格雷仰头喝干了最后一口酒。",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_narrator/source_flash_xuyuyuan/VO_Narrator_npc_arthur_dinner_watch_L02.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_Narrator_npc_arthur_dinner_watch_L02.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 3.6,
      "bytes": 28108
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_Narrator_npc_arthur_dinner_watch_L03",
      "text": "霍尔太太把伊芙琳椅背上的灰羊毛披肩往上提了提，免得拖到地上。",
      "source": "assets/audio/vo/vo_narrator/source_flash_xuyuyuan/VO_Narrator_npc_arthur_dinner_watch_L03.wav",
      "runtime": "public/assets/audio/vo/VO_Narrator_npc_arthur_dinner_watch_L03.ogg",
      "durationSeconds": 6.9,
      "bytes": 59502
    },
    {
      "clipId": "VO_Narrator_npc_arthur_confront_recording_L01",
      "text": "伊芙琳的声音在书房里响起来。亚瑟没有动，直到录音结束。",
